   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜ても: even though",
     "texto": [
      "With verbs, add **も** to the **て** form: **あめ が ふっても**. With -i adjectives, change **い** to **くても**: **たかくても**. With -na adjectives and nouns, use **でも**: **げんき でも** (even if you're well), **あめ でも** (even if it rains)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜ても かまいません: it doesn't matter if",
     "texto": [
      "To give permission calmly: **ここ で すわっても かまいません** (it doesn't matter if you sit here).",
      "To ask: **〜ても かまいません か** (does it matter if…?)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
